              "instruction": "ōṭṭunar urimam illāmal kār ōṭṭak kūṭātu. — You must not drive a car without a driving licence.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ōṭṭunar urimam illāmal kār ōṭṭak kūṭātu.* — You must not drive a car without a driving licence.]"
